EInvoicingMergeLineChargesField=Fold line charges into description
EInvoicingMergeLineChargesHelp=Overrides, for this supplier only, whether the charges of an invoice line (BG-28) are folded into the description of the product line instead of being imported as a line of their own. Leave on the global default unless this supplier specifically needs the other behaviour.
